,\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md:22:- **Use for:** running the integrated kidney pipeline when an image should be uploaded and passed through the Kidney Cancer Detection model, the Image Analyzer component, and the downstream X-AI component.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md:23:- **Suggestion rule:** If the diagnostic impression raises kidney-focused problems or a possible renal mass concern, suggest that the user can run this specialized pipeline and invite them to upload a CT image scan.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md:26:- **Default verbosity rule:** Do not include low-level run details in normal replies. Omit upload paths, endpoint values, HTTP status, node ids, workflow ids, raw file paths, and other execution metadata unless the user explicitly asks for technical or raw output.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:2:  \"uploaded_image_path\": \"upload/2026-03-20_17.29.59_LiEU58qjL6qC3LVa3UzG/file_3---9bc31cf5-4d95-43cd-b7ec-05734531e2ec.jpg\",\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:38:                    \"endpoint\": \"/nodes/input/upload\"\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:61:                    \"filename\": \"upload/2026-03-20_17.29.59_LiEU58qjL6qC3LVa3UzG/file_3---9bc31cf5-4d95-43cd-b7ec-05734531e2ec.jpg\",\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:147:                    \"File Path\": \"upload/2026-03-20_17.29.59_LiEU58qjL6qC3LVa3UzG/file_3---9bc31cf5-4d95-43cd-b7ec-05734531e2ec.jpg\",\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:223:  \"telegram_user_id_used_for_upload\": \"495506013\",\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:224:  \"upload_path\": \"upload/2026-03-20_17.29.59_LiEU58qjL6qC3LVa3UzG/\",\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney_pipeline_execution_response.json:225:  \"upload_filename\": \"file_3---9bc31cf5-4d95-43cd-b7ec-05